    <string name="compassInfo_bottom">Warning: Direction finding with electronic devices may not always give accurate results. For accurate results, please refer to the Masjids and Mosques near you.</string>
    <string name="compassInfo_header">"1. Turn on your location permission and location settings for correct direction.\n2. Wait for your device to find your location information.\n3. When your location is found, city / district / neighborhood information will be written under the compass.\n4. Make sure you have accurate location information.\n5. Place your device on a flat surface.\n6. Turn your device to the right or left according to the Kaaba symbol.\n7.When you enter the approximate degree range, the compass degree will turn green and you can head in this direction."</string>
